===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A pear-shaped organ that stores [[bile]] from the [[liver]], until the body needs it for the digestion and absorption of fats in the [[duodenum]].
#: {{syn|en|cholecyst|vescica biliaris|vescica fellea}}

